          "audioUrl": "audio/wraith_match_start_haze_wraith_convo01_01.mp3",
          "text": "You're not here for me, right?",
          "duration": 1.487
        },
        {
          "order": 2,
          "character": "Haze",
          "audioFile": "haze_match_start_haze_wraith_convo01_02",
          "audioUrl": "audio/haze_match_start_haze_wraith_convo01_02.mp3",
          "text": "The OSIC isn't concerned with your little casino, Wraith.",
          "duration": 4.151
        },
        {
          "order": 3,
          "character": "Wraith",
          "audioFile": "wraith_match_start_haze_wraith_convo01_03",
          "audioUrl": "audio/wraith_match_start_haze_wraith_convo01_03.mp3",
          "text": "I think \"little\" is underselling me a bit, but that's good to know",
          "duration": 3.264
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "conversationId": "haze_wraith_convo02",
      "lines": [
        {
          "order": 1,
          "character": "Haze",
          "audioFile": "haze_match_start_haze_wraith_convo02_01",
          "audioUrl": "audio/haze_match_start_haze_wraith_convo02_01.mp3",
          "text": "You look nervous.",
          "duration": 2.014
        },
        {
          "order": 2,
          "character": "Wraith",
          "audioFile": "wraith_match_start_haze_wraith_convo02_02",
          "audioUrl": "audio/wraith_match_start_haze_wraith_convo02_02.mp3",
          "text": "Anyone who says they aren't nervous when the stakes are high are either liars or morons.",
          "duration": 4.629
        },
        {
          "order": 3,
          "character": "Haze",
          "audioFile": "haze_match_start_haze_wraith_convo02_03",
          "audioUrl": "audio/haze_match_start_haze_wraith_convo02_03.mp3",
          "text": "I thought you were some big gambler.",
          "duration": 2.846
        },
        {
          "order": 4,
          "character": "Wraith",
          "audioFile": "wraith_match_start_haze_wraith_convo02_04",
          "audioUrl": "audio/wraith_match_start_haze_wraith_convo02_04.mp3",
          "text": "That's why I do it.  Nerves let you know you're alive.",
          "duration": 3.626
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "conversationId": "haze_wraith_convo03",
      "lines": [
        {
          "order": 1,
          "character": "Haze",
          "audioFile": "haze_match_start_haze_wraith_convo03_01",
          "audioUrl": "audio/haze_match_start_haze_wraith_convo03_01.mp3",
          "text": "Between the two of us we should make short work of them.",
